sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant P as NntpProxy
    participant S as ClientSession
    participant H as CommandHandler
    participant R as BackendSelector
    participant Pool as ConnectionProvider
    participant G as ConnectionGuard
    participant F as MultilineFramer
    participant B as Backend

    C->>P: TCP connect
    P->>S: Create session
    P->>C: NNTP greeting

    loop Commands
        C->>S: ARTICLE / BODY / other request
        S->>H: classify_request(RequestContext, auth_access, routing_mode)
        H-->>S: CommandPlan
        alt Local response
            H-->>C: Local status or capabilities response
        else Per-command route
            H->>R: Select eligible backend
            R-->>H: Selected backend
            H->>Pool: Acquire connection
            Pool-->>H: ConnectionGuard
            H->>G: Forward serialized request
            G->>B: Request bytes
            B-->>F: Response bytes
            F-->>C: Write completed response
            F-->>H: Transfer outcome
            H->>G: complete_success(), fail_client(), or fail_backend()
            G-->>Pool: Return reusable connection or remove it
        else Stateful route
            S->>B: Forward through dedicated backend connection
            B-->>F: Response bytes
            F->>F: Retain pending suffix for the next response
            F-->>C: Write completed response in order
        end
    end

    C->>S: QUIT
    S-->>C: 205 Goodbye
